# Force LF line endings for index.html regardless of platform or local
# core.autocrlf settings. Scoped to this one file (not the whole repo) to
# avoid an unrelated repo-wide line-ending diff. Added specifically because
# index.html's inline Travelpayouts trigger script is now referenced by an
# exact SHA-256 CSP hash (see vercel.json + scripts/prerender.mjs) — without
# this, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true produces CRLF locally
# while Vercel's Linux build container checks out LF, silently producing two
# different hashes for the "same" file and breaking the CSP allowlist in
# production.
index.html text eol=lf
